---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="钢板网（菱形网）— 规格、价格与安平工厂" description="钢板网用于走道、格栅、过滤及建筑装饰。菱形与六角形孔型，材质规格，安平工厂直供。" lang="zh">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0 prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">钢板网（菱形网）</h1>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">钢板网由整张金属板经切割拉伸而成，形成刚性开放的网状结构，无焊点无接缝。安平工厂大量生产，用于走道格栅、平台地板、机器防护、过滤器及建筑幕墙。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">材质</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>材料</th><th>常用牌号</th><th>板厚</th><th>适用场景</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>低碳钢</td><td>Q235, A36</td><td>0.5–6.0mm</td><td>走道、格栅、通用</td></tr>
          <tr><td>镀锌钢</td><td>DX51D, SGCC</td><td>0.5–4.0mm</td><td>户外、耐腐蚀</td></tr>
          <tr><td>不锈钢</td><td>304, 316</td><td>0.5–3.0mm</td><td>食品、化工、海洋</td></tr>
          <tr><td>铝合金</td><td>1060, 3003, 5052</td><td>0.5–4.0mm</td><td>建筑、轻量化</td></tr>
          <tr><td>铜 / 黄铜</td><td>C11000, H62</td><td>0.5–2.0mm</td><td>装饰、电磁屏蔽</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">常用规格</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>孔型</th><th>短节距×长节距 (mm)</th><th>梗宽 (mm)</th><th>板厚 (mm)</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>菱形</td><td>10×25</td><td>1.0–1.5</td><td>0.5–1.0</td><td>过滤、筛网</td></tr>
          <tr><td>菱形</td><td>20×50</td><td>1.5–2.5</td><td>1.0–2.0</td><td>机器防护、货架</td></tr>
          <tr><td>菱形</td><td>30×75</td><td>2.0–3.0</td><td>2.0–3.0</td><td>走道、平台</td></tr>
          <tr><td>菱形</td><td>50×100</td><td>3.0–5.0</td><td>3.0–5.0</td><td>重型格栅、天桥</td></tr>
          <tr><td>六角形</td><td>15×40</td><td>1.0–2.0</td><td>0.5–1.5</td><td>建筑、装饰</td></tr>
          <tr><td>方形</td><td>20×20</td><td>1.5–2.5</td><td>1.0–2.0</td><td>隔断、吊顶</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">短节距 = 菱形孔短对角线中心距，长节距 = 长对角线中心距。<a href="/zh/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">估算重量 →</a></p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">订货时需要说明</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>材质和牌号（如 SS304、Q235、3003 铝）</li>
        <li>短节距 × 长节距（mm，网孔尺寸）</li>
        <li>梗宽和板厚</li>
        <li>板材尺寸（标准：1000×2000mm、1220×2440mm，或定制）</li>
        <li>表面处理方式：原板、镀锌、喷塑、阳极氧化</li>
        <li>数量（m² 或张数）</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">价格参考</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">产品</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">规格</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">价格范围 (USD/m²)</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">起订量</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">交期</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">低碳钢板网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20×50mm，1.5mm 梗，1.5mm 厚</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$8–15/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">10–15 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">镀锌钢板网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">30×75mm，2.5mm 梗，2.5mm 厚</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$12–20/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">12–18 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">不锈钢板网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20×50mm，1.5mm 梗，1.5mm 厚</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$25–45/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–25 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">铝板网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15×40mm，1.2mm 梗，1.0mm 厚</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$18–35/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–22 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">重型格栅板网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×100mm，4.0mm 梗，5.0mm 厚</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$30–55/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20–30 天</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted mb-6">*2025–2026 年参考价格。实际价格取决于材料成本、板厚、订单量及表面处理方式。请务必索取正式报价。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">常见问题</h2>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">短节距和长节距是什么意思？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">短节距（SWD）= 菱形孔短对角线中心距，长节距（LWD）= 长对角线中心距。例如 30×75 表示短节距 30mm、长节距 75mm。这是钢板网最关键的规格参数。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">钢板网比焊接网更坚固吗？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">是的 — 钢板网由整板拉伸而成，无焊点无接缝，各方向强度均匀，切割后不会散架。焊接网在焊点处可能开裂。走道和平台等承重场景，钢板网是更安全的选择。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">钢板网能用作防滑地板吗？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">可以。选择<strong>凸起型</strong>（标准型）钢板网，不要选压平型。凸起的梗丝形成天然防滑面。楼梯踏步可加齿纹或压边防滑条。更宽的梗和更厚的板增加承载能力。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">凸起型和压平型钢板网有什么区别？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">凸起型（标准型）：梗丝呈一定角度，形成 3D 立体表面，防滑性和刚性更好。压平型：经辊压后表面平整、厚度更薄，适合过滤器、防护罩及需要平面的建筑装饰。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">开孔率怎么计算？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">开孔率 ≈ (1 – 梗宽/短节距) × (1 – 梗宽/长节距) × 100%。开孔率越高，通风排水越好，但强度越低。标准钢板网开孔率约 40–70%，视孔型而定。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">能定制喷塑或阳极氧化吗？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">可以。喷塑（任意 RAL 色）增加防腐和美观，适合建筑用途。铝合金板网可做阳极氧化。钢材户外使用通常镀锌。订货时说明表面处理类型和色卡号。</p>
      </details>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">获取安平钢板网工厂报价</p>
        <a href="/zh/inquiry/" class="inline-block mt-3 accent-bg hover:accent-bg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors">发送询盘 →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="lg:w-80 shrink-0">
      <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
        <!-- Quick Tools -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快捷工具</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">计算与换算</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 重量计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 集装箱装载计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> FOB 价格计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/inquiry-template-generator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 询盘模板生成器
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Specs -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快速规格</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">钢板网标准</h3>
          <dl class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">短节距</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">10–100 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">长节距</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">25–300 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">梗宽</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">0.8–6.0 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">板厚</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">0.5–6.0 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">材质</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">钢 / 不锈钢 / 铝 / 铜</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">标准</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">ASTM F1267<br/>ISO 9044</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Products -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">相关产品</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">相关产品</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/perforated-metal/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 冲孔板
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/stainless-steel-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 不锈钢丝网
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 焊接网
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>